Xray screenshot usage notice

These five screenshots were supplied by the project owner for Xray's Hexly
project introduction. The current authorization is preparation and local review.
The source repository has no root LICENSE file at the inspected revision; this
import does not assign an MIT or other independent license to the screenshots.

Original interface artwork, browser chrome and embedded fixture imagery retain
their existing rights. The import preserves the original files and only creates
smaller full-canvas WebP previews and thumbnails. No new image generation,
cropping, recoloring or removal of source attribution was performed.
